<title>RUSSIA: Russia C.Bank makes no bill trades for MoF on Tues.</title>
<headline>Russia C.Bank makes no bill trades for MoF on Tues.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank did not intervene on the government securities market on behalf of the Finance Ministry on Tuesday, the bank's open-market operations department said.</p>
<p>Apart from intervening on its own account for liquidity-smoothing and monetary policy purposes, the central bank buys and sells securities as part of its management of the Finance Ministry's debt and asset portfolio.</p>
